; Directories dune builds. design/ is offline Python; js/ is carried only for
; its differential test, which runs under `dune test`; wordlist/ holds shared
; input data that ocaml/lib generates a module from; wasm/ holds the committed
; wasm build of the verified core, which the wasm differential rule replays.
;
; ui/ is here for exactly one file: js/worker-differential.mjs drives the real
; ui/public/core.worker.js, and a test that cannot declare its subject as a
; dependency is a test that stops re-running when the subject changes -- which
; is the failure tools/check-suites.sh exists because of. ui/dune marks the
; whole tree data-only, so dune reads files there and builds nothing.
(dirs ocaml vectors js wordlist wasm ui)

; dune 3.17 dropped warning 30 -- two mutually recursive record types sharing
; a field name -- from the dev profile's error set. Lang 3.6, which this
; project used until the js bundle needed newer dune fields, promoted it.
; Nothing here relied on the relaxation and a shadowed field resolves
; silently, so it is put back rather than inherited.
(env (_ (flags (:standard -w @30))))
